! ForgeShare — private collaboration

Share wikis and sites with family or collaborators through Tailscale. Choose them by name in the helper. It finds an available address and preserves other services. Use ''Copy address'' for the current link if the address has changed.

Open the control panel and choose the ''ForgeShare'' tab for setup, Mac/Windows/Linux helpers, safe sharing, sync and backup. If the tab is missing, enable the plugin, save and reload the wiki.

The language follows TiddlyWiki's own language selector: both ''Dansk (Danmark)'' and ''HUWiki Dansk'' display Danish. There is no additional selector. Other languages use the English guide.

''Test release 0.1.13.'' Importing the plugin starts no server, changes no access rules and installs no programs. Download and start the helper locally. Node.js must be installed; Tailscale is needed for Tailscale or Funnel sharing. HTML/offline copies remain available.
